Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see your cultivation has improved greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has yet to match my handsomeness...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you borrow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that straw hat for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are still 99 wood carvings left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget them when you reach Soul Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are the carvings of Senior
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promised to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your past guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, I just want to reclaim my soul strand,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yunque Zi, an Ascendant cultivator, entered the Suzaku Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means something else is happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must reclaim my soul strand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and avoid getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You ruined my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I will kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have faced countless enemies before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:30.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this kind of gaze that can make my heart tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,can only mean one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si’s demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tuo Sen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I leave this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if you flee to the ends of the cosmos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll capture and refine you !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,He should’ve attacked me on sight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to seize the memory inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:03:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he hasn’t attacked yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead, he entered the Suzaku Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does he also seek the Cultivation Planet Crystal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,His cultivation likely surpasses Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only person that can face him here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Yunque Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The aura of an Ancient God ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it’s on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What’s happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,What’s going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mountain is crumbling !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gate has opened !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will open the mountain gate !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:07.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,465)\fad(300,300)}Golden Sea\NSuzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,As Situ said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,that must be Ye Wuyou’s tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But entering it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,definitely won’t be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,A defensive restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Tuo Sen’s power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,the puppet's cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,has indeed reached Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zi Xin and I planned to use the Water Escape Technique to sneak in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it’s impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This golden-armored giant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn’t attack to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,To enter Ye Wuyou’s tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you just need to withstand one strike
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this sword’s power...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you realized
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this strike is Ascendant-level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,None of us can withstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rather than wait for death here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,let the three of us join forces to resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,the both of us will face the sword first,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,then my Junior Sister will take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will face the sword first
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then you two take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu is only Early stage Soul Transformation yet is so presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He must be relying on that Soul Flag again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can get my hands on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Ceng, don’t panic !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Feng is here !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,prepare to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Asc...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Passage of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.56,Third,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This must be the statue of the first Suzaku, Ye Wuyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,That light...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be the Cultivation Planet Crystal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where’s Yunque Zi ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s you, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you’re here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,lend me your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’re the third to enter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the person who followed you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just a fragment of his Divine Sense
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is enough to have an Ascendant cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,After fighting him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I temporarily trapped him in this formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:17.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the relation between Yunque Zi and Tuo Sen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems to go beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still need to coax the truth out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m gravely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could you get the Cultivation Planet Crystal for me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,For my Forsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and for you cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cultivation Planet Crystal must not shatter !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:51.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,who that person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is his relation with you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will not approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just learned that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,he is the one that orchestrated
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the fall of planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thousands of years ago, my clan was driven underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I carried their hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and infiltrated the country of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,as Qian Pinghai’s disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I trained relentlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become the next Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,restore my clan’s freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and escape the eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I never imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that my Senior Brother would seize the position of Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,After thousands of years of waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,we ended up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disillusioned with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Xu abandoned hopes of peace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and activated the ancient altar
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to seek for greater powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little did we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,beneath planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,lies the corpse of an Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,A strand of his Divine Sense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,answered our prayers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,by helping Ancestor Xu to breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and shatter the first Suzaku's seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Xu seemed to have gone mad
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he waged war on Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just realized that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this war
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,was just a part of that demon's scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,was a scheme to obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tuo Sen’s scheme to try to get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,can only mean only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can free him from the Blood Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not be able to escape him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,See for yourself with your Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he escapes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:22.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will take the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,When that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,all hope will be lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior is at his limit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,then why is your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,unexpectedly stable ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you notice ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,That’s not the Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,go ahead and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're worthy of being one of my 4 candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,that isn't the Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is only a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Touching it costs a high price
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reveals the location of the true crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that if you retrieve the crystal for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll gift you my clan’s treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to use the straw hat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,as a deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're my benefactor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'd rather not fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to get my soul strand back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and leave planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to pursue my own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But since Senior threatens to harm me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that if I touch this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will die for sure. Am I right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But your death
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,will allow me to repair the Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and save countless lives !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is a righteous act !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you’re so righteous,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,then teach me how to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and die a noble death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think your Soul Flag can match me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I know someone that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that formation was quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using remnants of dead soul fragments as a formation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,can indeed trap Master's Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:16.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal for Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And no one can stop me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere puppet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:23.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as I can destroy your Divine Sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:26.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter how strong your true body is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won’t be able to get here now !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1621,452)}Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Planet Crystal !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The day Master will be free is before me !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tuo Sen's Ascendant puppet was killed in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Planet Crystal really is deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,What !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:27.56,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1577,465)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Seal Pagoda\NInside the Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,willing to become
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:34.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the titled Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.85,0:18:59.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:02.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:10.29,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.53,0:19:10.29,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:17.89,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:17.89,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:25.45,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:25.45,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.77,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.77,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:32.49,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:32.49,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:36.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:39.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:43.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:48.05,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.05,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:53.01,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:53.01,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:59.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:03.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:07.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:11.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:17.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:21.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:26.01,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:26.01,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:29.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:33.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:37.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:41.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:45.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:48.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:52.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:55.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:21:01.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
